WEBVTT

00:10:28.749 --> 00:10:32.670
we'll have made the transition
from scarcity thinking

00:10:32.711 --> 00:10:37.257
to appreciating the true wealth
that we possess.

00:10:37.257 --> 00:10:39.301
Our ingenuity,

00:10:39.301 --> 00:10:41.387
our compassion

00:10:41.387 --> 00:10:42.763
and our humanity.

00:10:43.347 --> 00:10:44.515
Thank you.

00:10:44.556 --> 00:10:51.105
(Applause)

00:10:52.147 --> 00:10:54.149
Helen Walters: Juliet, thank you so much.

00:10:54.191 --> 00:10:56.402
I have a very practical question for you.

00:10:56.443 --> 00:11:00.072
So you mentioned in the talk
that people were taking Friday off.